 "text": "Hey there, how are you doing? It a nice number. Do you have a place big enough to fit everyone, would you rather have breaks? Then think about summer heat and people moving around. Would you rather everyone come at once, or small groups over a few days? If you want a unifying dish, ask everyone what they like and don't have, and see how many people want it hot or cold. That's a good one. Pick a couple of side dishes too, and see if anyone brings the usual dessert. Keep it simple. One room per couple, with a few single roomies rooming together. Keep the door open.",
